WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:16.386
I am Sir Jeffrey, a knight of the royal court of England in the twelfth century.

2
00:00:17.326 --> 00:00:22.488
The twelfth century was the High Middle Ages when noble men in shining armor ruled the land.

3
00:00:23.889 --> 00:00:27.890
My story is full of the adventures and glory that only a knight could have known.

4
00:00:29.031 --> 00:00:33.617
I spent years on the Second and Third Crusades, fighting to capture the city of Jerusalem.

5
00:00:34.917 --> 00:00:37.958
This city had been occupied for many years by Arab Muslims.

6
00:00:39.298 --> 00:00:46.980
So, in 1187, Pope Gregory VIII stated that all knights should ride across Europe to the Middle East

7
00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:48.121
and take the city.

8
00:00:49.021 --> 00:00:52.962
But before I could do that, I had to spend many years becoming a knight.

9
00:00:54.122 --> 00:00:57.583
I began my journey to knighthood as a page at the age of seven.

10
00:00:58.303 --> 00:01:01.528
I left home to live at the castle of a lord.

11
00:01:01.548 --> 00:01:08.132
As a page, I played many training games with other pages, such as wrestling, sword fighting, and lance

12
00:01:08.172 --> 00:01:15.356
practice. When we practiced sword and lance skills, we used wooden weapons to be safe.

13
00:01:16.277 --> 00:01:19.198
My other lessons involved the lady and lord of the castle.

14
00:01:20.819 --> 00:01:23.961
I would spend the day serving my lord in all things.

15
00:01:24.822 --> 00:01:28.584
If his armor was rusted or dirty, it was my job to clean it.

16
00:01:29.672 --> 00:01:34.776
My lord taught me how to hunt, usually with a bow and arrow, but also with a hawk.

17
00:01:35.936 --> 00:01:40.379
The lady of the castle showed me how to be a gentleman by teaching me good manners.

18
00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:47.124
This was very important because a knight is not only a warrior, but a noble person who always

19
00:01:47.164 --> 00:01:48.024
does what is right.

20
00:01:49.185 --> 00:01:52.968
Another big part of my day involved learning about God and religion.

21
00:01:53.888 --> 00:01:59.392
This was important because many knights, including myself, were deeply religious Christians.

22
00:02:00.576 --> 00:02:05.379
When I was 14, I was chosen to become a squire, a knight's servant or apprentice.

23
00:02:06.599 --> 00:02:09.841
A squire takes care of the knight's weapons and carries them for him.

24
00:02:11.102 --> 00:02:17.285
In battle, the squire quickly replaces any damaged shield or armor, so the knight can continue fighting.

25
00:02:18.746 --> 00:02:23.729
During my time as a squire, I learned the ways of combat and warfare from my lord.

26
00:02:24.729 --> 00:02:29.352
Now, instead of training with wooden weapons, the other squires and I used real ones.

27
00:02:30.644 --> 00:02:37.030
We studied siege warfare, or how to surround and blockade a city, and the art of commanding soldiers.

28
00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:40.853
As squires, we became expert horsemen.

29
00:02:41.493 --> 00:02:44.196
We learned to ride horses and fight at the same time.

30
00:02:45.196 --> 00:02:47.919
We also practiced fighting while wearing heavy armor.

31
00:02:48.659 --> 00:02:53.804
Sometimes during a battle, we were allowed to fight alongside our lord instead of just serving him.

32
00:02:55.145 --> 00:02:59.520
A squire could become a knight between the ages of eighteen and twenty.

33
00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:04.702
When I was thought worthy of becoming a knight, I did everything a squire must do just before

34
00:03:04.782 --> 00:03:05.882
a knighting ceremony.

35
00:03:06.722 --> 00:03:09.543
I prayed throughout the night, refusing to eat or sleep.

36
00:03:10.743 --> 00:03:15.125
When morning came, I took a warm bath and put on a special padded vest and hood.

37
00:03:16.285 --> 00:03:20.006
Next, I put on my full armor, which was well-polished and shiny.

38
00:03:21.326 --> 00:03:24.567
Over this armor, I put on a fine white tunic or shirt.

39
00:03:25.427 --> 00:03:26.948
White was the color of purity.

40
00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:30.681
I was finally ready to be knighted, or "dubbed," a knight.

41
00:03:32.021 --> 00:03:38.183
For the ceremony, I knelt before my lord and I received my sword, my lance, and golden spurs.

42
00:03:39.563 --> 00:03:44.885
I recited a special oath, or promise, to be loyal and obey him in all things.

43
00:03:46.205 --> 00:03:52.107
I also took the oath of chivalry to protect the weak and defenseless, defend the church, speak the

44
00:03:52.147 --> 00:03:55.528
truth, respect women, and live an honorable life.

45
00:03:57.544 --> 00:04:03.129
Then the lord performing the ceremony touched me on the shoulders with a sword and said, "I dub

46
00:04:03.169 --> 00:04:04.130
thee Sir Knight."

47
00:04:06.372 --> 00:04:09.455
I had knelt as a squire, but I rose as a knight.

48
00:04:11.577 --> 00:04:16.141
As a knight, I was free to travel, but I always had to be available for my lord

49
00:04:16.462 --> 00:04:17.863
in both peace and in war.

50
00:04:19.004 --> 00:04:23.188
But most of the time, before I went on the Crusades, I fought in tournaments.

51
00:04:23.968 --> 00:04:29.091
Tournaments were very common events that allowed knights to compete against each other in combat with swords and

52
00:04:29.151 --> 00:04:35.215
lances. Even though the competitions were games, they were very dangerous and many knights died.

53
00:04:36.135 --> 00:04:40.518
These events could determine a knight's fortune, since knights often bet their wealth on a tournament.

54
00:04:41.498 --> 00:04:43.960
To be beaten was to lose money and reputation.

55
00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.881
To win was to gain wealth and fame.

56
00:04:48.962 --> 00:04:51.524
After the Crusades, I eventually returned to England.

57
00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:56.465
I continued to participate in tournaments and fight wars to gain land and money.

58
00:04:57.927 --> 00:05:01.592
I even taught my own pages and squires as I had been taught.

59
00:05:02.673 --> 00:05:07.218
When I look back on my life, I am proud to say that I was a true knight,

60
00:05:08.039 --> 00:05:11.323
performed my duties well, and fought for my beliefs.
